### 637-actuator-non-health-requires-auth.http — health 외 actuator는 인증 필요
### https://github.com/prgrms-be-adv-devcourse/beadv7_7_earlybird_BE/issues/637
###
### SecurityConfig는 /actuator/health, /actuator/health/**만 permitAll이고, 그 외 actuator
### 엔드포인트(예: /actuator/gateway/routes)는 anyExchange().authenticated()에 걸린다.

### 1. Authorization 헤더 없이 /actuator/gateway/routes 호출 — 401이어야 함
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/gateway/routes

> {%
    client.test("토큰 없이 /actuator/gateway/routes 호출은 401", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 401, "expected 401, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
    });
%}

### 2. 회원가입 + 로그인 (인증된 토큰 확보)
< {%
    client.global.set("userEmail", "uc637-" + Date.now() + "@earlybird.co.kr");
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "rawPassword1!",
  "name": "유스케이스637",
  "phoneNumber": "010-1111-2222"
}

> {%
    client.test("회원가입 성공(200)", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "signup failed: " + response.body);
    });
%}

### 3. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "rawPassword1!"
}

> {%
    client.test("로그인 성공", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "login failed: " + response.body);
    });
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 4. 인증된 토큰으로 재요청 — management.endpoint.gateway.access: read-only 이므로 조회는 가능해야 함
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/gateway/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("인증된 사용자는 /actuator/gateway/routes 조회 가능(200)", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "expected 200, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
    });
%}
